    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d541">

                <pb facs="0771" n="751" sameAs="frus:frus1864p2/pg751"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr.
                        Burnley.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-10-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >October</hi> 22, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to acknowledge the receipt
                    of your note of the 20th instant, informing me that Thomas and Charles Jones,
                    captured on board the Lilian, and who were the subjects of your note of the 15th
                    instant, had been transferred from Camp Hamilton to the military prison at Point
                    Lookout. In reply, I have the honor to inform you that I have advised the proper
                    departments of this change.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, with high consideration, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>J <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hume Burnley,</hi> Esq., &amp;<hi
                            rendition="#italic">c., &amp;c, &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
